{%- doc -%}
  An order's buttons, on its card and on its own page (docs/account-hub-plan.md §4.2), at most two, by its state:
  - on its way, with a courier link: Track parcel + Need help?
  - shipped earlier, cancelled or refunded: Buy again (when something in it is still for sale) + Need help?
  - confirmed, not shipped yet: Need help?
  Buy again is a real form (/cart/add); account-page.js adds without leaving the page and says so in the line below.

  @param {string} name - "#1042"
  @param {string} [track_url] - The courier's tracking page, while it's on its way
  @param {string} [buy] - The pieces still for sale, as "variant_id:qty,variant_id:qty"
  @param {number} [skipped] - How many pieces are sold out (left out of Buy again)
  @param {string} help_url - WhatsApp (prefilled with the order number) or the contact page
  @param {boolean} [help_new_tab] - true when help_url is WhatsApp
{%- enddoc -%}
<div class="order-card__actions">
  {%- if track_url != blank -%}
    <a class="btn order-card__btn" href="{{ track_url }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
      {%- render 'icon', icon: 'truck' -%}
      {{- 'account.track_parcel' | t -}}
      <span class="visually-hidden">, {{ 'account.for_order' | t: name: name }} ({{ 'accessibility.new_window' | t }})</span>
    </a>
  {%- elsif buy != blank -%}
    {%- assign pairs = buy | split: ',' -%}
    <form class="order-card__form" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post" data-buy-again data-skipped="{{ skipped | default: 0 }}">
      {%- for pair in pairs -%}
        {%- assign bits = pair | split: ':' -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="items[][id]" value="{{ bits[0] }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="items[][quantity]" value="{{ bits[1] }}">
      {%- endfor -%}
      <button type="submit" class="btn order-card__btn">
        {%- render 'icon', icon: 'replace' -%}
        <span data-buy-label>{{ 'account.buy_again' | t }}</span>
        <span class="visually-hidden">, {{ 'account.for_order' | t: name: name }}</span>
      </button>
    </form>
  {%- endif -%}
  <a class="btn btn--ghost order-card__btn" href="{{ help_url }}" {% if help_new_tab %}rel="noopener" target="_blank"{% endif %}>
    {%- render 'icon', icon: 'whatsapp' -%}
    {{- 'account.need_help' | t -}}
    <span class="visually-hidden"> {{ 'account.for_order' | t: name: name }}{% if help_new_tab %} ({{ 'accessibility.new_window' | t }}){% endif %}</span>
  </a>
</div>
<p class="order-card__added" data-buy-note role="status"></p>
